e=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Recommend strategies to reduce cost and minimize risk</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Site inspection facilitation</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Execute:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Hotel selection decision support</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Communicate decisions to venues</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Assess event execution</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Guide client through contracting process</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Offsite event sourcing</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"line-height:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Emergency preparedness</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px; line-height:normal; margin-left:120px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></p></div><div id=\"comp-ko215ss4\" class=\"MazNVa comp-ko215ss4 wixui-image\"><div data-testid=\"linkElement\" class=\"j7pOnl\"><img loading=\"lazy\" id=\"img_comp-ko215ss4\" src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_4856594d9feb4ffb9b5917fc323de859~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_214,h_109,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Gretchen%20CVent%20certifications%20image.png\" alt=\"Gretchen CVent certifications image.png\" style=\"object-fit:cover\" class=\"BI8PVQ Tj01hh\" width=\"214\" height=\"109\"></div></div><div id=\"comp-l1kwk6go\" class=\"comp-l1kwk6go\" data-semantic-classname=\"button\"><a data-testid=\"linkElement\" href=\"https://www.reachmeetings.com/contact\" target=\"_self\" class=\"StylableButton2545352419__root style-l1l09lcc__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link\" aria-label=\"Contact Us\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__container\"><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label\" data-testid=\"stylablebutton-label\">Contact Us</span><span class=\"StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"stylablebutton-icon\"><span><svg data-bbox=\"13.05 2.55 33.878 54.8\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n    <g>\n        <path d=\"M46.5 28.9L20.6 3c-.6-.6-1.6-.6-2.2 0l-4.8 4.8c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l19.8 20-19.9 19.9c-.6.6-.6 1.6 0 2.2l4.8 4.8c.6.6 1.6.6 2.2 0l21-21 4.8-4.8c.8-.6.8-1.6.2-2.2z\"></path>\n    </g>\n</svg>\n</span></span></span></a></div><div data-mesh-id=\"comp-lhqkvr3minlineContent-wedge-4\"></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><div id=\"soapAfterPagesContainer\" class=\"soapAfterPagesContainer page-without-sosp\"><div data-mesh-id=\"soapAfterPagesContainerinlineContent\" data-testid=\"inline-content\" class=\"\"><div data-mesh-id=